# Code owners for tapelibrary_exporter.
#
# When a pull request touches a matched path, the listed owner is
# automatically requested for review. This only wires the automatic review
# request - enforcing it (blocking merge without that review) is a separate,
# opt-in branch-protection setting ("Require review from Code Owners").
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                       @sckyzo

# Supply-chain / CI-sensitive paths - called out explicitly so ownership of
# the release, signing, and CI plumbing stays unambiguous even if more
# owners are added to the catch-all above later.
/.github/               @sckyzo
/Dockerfile*            @sckyzo
/.goreleaser*           @sckyzo
/scripts/docker/        @sckyzo
